{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "7de52107-238e-487a-af63-a1f90e737bae",
    "name": "📌 fal.ai API",
    "description": "### About\n\n\"fal is the generative media inference platform: call 1,000+ models via one API, deploy your own on serverless GPUs, or train on GPU clusters.\"\n\nfal.ai hosts image, video and audio models from many labs, such as Google's Nano Banana and Veo, behind one queue-based API. On the workspace overview it is listed under **Image & video**.\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n- Postman Account\n    \n- fal.ai Account: [https://fal.ai/dashboard](https://fal.ai/dashboard)\n    \n\n### Usage\n\n1. Create a fork\n    \n2. Update collection variables\n    \n3. Send requests\n\nStart with the 🚀 Get Started folder.\n\nAdd your key to your **Postman Vault** as `fal_ai_api_key` (Vault icon in the footer, then **Add secret**, using that exact name). Requests read it as `{{vault:fal_ai_api_key}}`, so your key never leaves your device.\n\n### Documentation\n\n- API: [https://fal.ai/dashboard](https://fal.ai/dashboard)\n    \n- Models: [https://fal.ai/models](https://fal.ai/models)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "createdAt": "2025-02-15T15:03:05.000Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-10-12T23:53:21.000Z",
